MODIFICATIONS IN THIS FORK
===============================================================================

Every source file that differs from upstream carries a header comment
beginning with "Modified from the original QuizGate TV project".
The following files were modified or added:

  Modified:
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/BootReceiver.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/GateService.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/MainActivity.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/MaskView.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/NotifProbe.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/Prefs.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/Core.java
