    app/src/main/assets/quiz/*

  Added:
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/LanServer.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/WrongBookView.java
    app/src/main/java/app/quizgate/tv/MultiSelectPanel.java

Summary of changes:

  - Window-focus arbitration fix for Hisense VIDAA (FLAG_ALT_FOCUSABLE_IM,
    removal of FLAG_DIM_BEHIND, in-place MaskView reattach, exponential backoff).
  - Audio focus preemption (AUDIOFOCUS_GAIN_TRANSIENT_EXCLUSIVE), media pause
    dispatch, and STREAM_MUSIC muting while the gate is shown.
  - Multi-grade (1-9, bitmask) and multi-subject quiz selection.
  - Expanded offline question bank under app/src/main/assets/quiz/.
  - Daily screen-time cap, night curfew, eye-rest reminders.
  - Anti-guessing guards: minimum read time, wrong-answer cooldown.
  - Wrong-answer workbook and star points
  - Full-screen wrong-answer explainer overlay with per-question
    subject/grade badges and dynamic-question step-by-step explanations (v1.6.7).
  - Adult (bypass) mode with automatic restore on next boot.
  - Idle / screen-off re-lock.
  - Local-area parent console listening on TCP port 8787.

